#### 7.8 云存储测试

##### 7.8.1 云存储测试概述

云存储已成为现代数据架构的核心组件，云存储测试需要关注云服务商特定的特性和多云环境下的兼容性。

**云存储类型**：
- **对象存储**：AWS S3、Azure Blob Storage、Google Cloud Storage、阿里云OSS
- **块存储**：AWS EBS、Azure Disk Storage、Google Persistent Disk
- **文件存储**：AWS EFS、Azure Files、Google Filestore、NFS on Cloud

##### 7.8.2 云存储测试关注点

> **[第2篇-019]** 云存储测试关注点表格  
> **锚点类型**: 建议  
> **锚点方法**: 表格  
> **补充建议**: 【目标】梳理云存储测试关注点。建议步骤：1. 输出对象存储、块存储、文件存储的测试要点。2. 对比不同云服务商的特性。详见主书稿。  
> **引用附件**: examples/07_storage/cloud_storage_focus_points.yml  
> **状态**: 已完成  
> **版本**: v1.0  
> **时间戳**: 2025-12-24  

| 存储类型 | 关键特性 | 测试关注点 | 工具/方法 |
|---------|----------|-----------|-----------|
| 对象存储 | 高持久性、无限扩展 | 上传/下载一致性、版本控制、多AZ复制 | AWS CLI + Custom Scripts |
| 块存储 | 低延迟、高IOPS | 挂载/卸载、快照、加密 | fio + dd + Cloud SDK |
| 文件存储 | 共享文件系统 | NFS/SMB兼容性、权限、并发访问 | mount + rsync + Filebench |

**云存储核心测试场景**：
- **数据持久性验证**：测试11个9的持久性保证，验证纠删码和多副本机制
- **跨区域复制测试**：验证数据在不同区域/可用区间的复制延迟和一致性
- **访问控制测试**：IAM策略、Bucket Policy、预签名URL、临时凭证
- **成本优化测试**：存储类切换（热/温/冷）、生命周期策略、压缩效果
- **性能基准测试**：吞吐量、IOPS、延迟在不同存储类的表现
- **合规性测试**：数据加密、审计日志、保留策略、数据主权

##### 7.8.4 云服务商专项配置示例

**AWS S3 生产环境配置**：

```yaml
# aws_s3_production_config.yml
# AWS S3生产环境测试配置

s3_buckets:
  standard:
    name: "prod-data-standard-${env}"
    region: "us-east-1"
    storage_class: "STANDARD"
    versioning: true
    encryption:
      type: "SSE-KMS"
      kms_key_id: "alias/prod-data-key"
    lifecycle:
      - prefix: "logs/"
        expiration_days: 30
        transition_days: 7
        storage_class: "STANDARD_IA"
      - prefix: "archive/"
        expiration_days: 365
        storage_class: "GLACIER"

  intelligent_tiering:
    name: "prod-data-intelligent-${env}"
    region: "us-west-2"
    storage_class: "INTELLIGENT_TIERING"
    intelligent_tiering:
      prefix: "analytics/"
      archive_access_days: 90
      deep_archive_access_days: 180

s3_testing_scenarios:
  cross_region_replication:
    source_bucket: "prod-data-standard-us-east-1"
    destination_bucket: "prod-data-replica-us-west-2"
    replication_role: "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/replication-role"
    replication_rules:
      - id: "replicate-all"
        status: "Enabled"
        prefix: ""
        destination:
          bucket: "arn:aws:s3:::prod-data-replica-us-west-2"

  presigned_url_testing:
    bucket: "prod-data-standard-${env}"
    key: "sensitive-document.pdf"
    expiration: 3600  # 1 hour
    allowed_operations: ["get_object", "put_object"]

  batch_operations:
    manifest_prefix: "batch-manifests/"
    operations:
      - type: "copy"
        source_bucket: "prod-data-standard-${env}"
        destination_bucket: "prod-data-archive-${env}"
        storage_class: "GLACIER"
```

**Azure Blob Storage 生产环境配置**：

```yaml
# azure_blob_production_config.yml
# Azure Blob Storage生产环境测试配置

storage_accounts:
  hot_tier:
    name: "prodstoragehot${env}"
    kind: "StorageV2"
    sku: "Standard_LRS"
    access_tier: "Hot"
    allow_blob_public_access: false
    minimum_tls_version: "TLS1_2"
    network_rules:
      default_action: "Deny"
      virtual_network_rules:
        - virtual_network_resource_id: "/subscriptions/.../virtualNetworks/prod-vnet"
      ip_rules:
        - "10.0.0.0/8"

  cool_tier:
    name: "prodstoragecool${env}"
    kind: "StorageV2"
    sku: "Standard_LRS"
    access_tier: "Cool"
    blob_soft_delete: true
    blob_soft_delete_retention_days: 7

azure_testing_scenarios:
  geo_redundant_storage:
    primary_account: "prodstoragehot${env}"
    secondary_account: "prodstoragehot${env}secondary"
    replication_type: "GRS"
    failover_testing:
      manual_failover: true
      planned_failover: false

  lifecycle_management:
    rules:
      - name: "archive-old-data"
        enabled: true
        type: "Lifecycle"
        definition:
          filters:
            blobTypes: ["blockBlob"]
            prefixMatch: ["archive/"]
          actions:
            baseBlob:
              tierToCool:
                daysAfterModificationGreaterThan: 30
              tierToArchive:
                daysAfterModificationGreaterThan: 90
              delete:
                daysAfterModificationGreaterThan: 365

  shared_access_signatures:
    container: "private-data"
    permissions: "r"  # read only
    expiry: "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z"
    start: "2025-12-24T00:00:00Z"
    ip_range: "192.168.1.0-192.168.1.255"
```

